      "why_it_works": "The signup hook checks only getPendingInvitationByEmail(email); that query checks status='pending' without token possession or expiry. Configuration sets autoSignIn: !config.enableSignup and requireEmailVerification: config.enableSignup, issuing an unverified session. Passkey registration requires a fresh session but never emailVerified. Magic-link verification promotes the same user after revokeUnprovenAccountAccess, which deletes only accounts whose providerId === 'credential' and existing sessions; it leaves Passkey rows intact. Passkey authentication then calls createSession(passkey.userId). The separate /verify-email path also promotes the account without clearing the attacker’s original password or sessions.",
