      "why_it_works": "The invitation plugin matches only paths starting with '/sign-up/email'. Magic links explicitly set disableSignUp: false; verification calls createUser when no user exists. Social-provider configuration supplies neither disableSignUp nor an invitation-aware creation guard, so the OAuth handler reaches createOAuthUser.",
